{
  "description": "PBKDF2-SHA512 PHC strings: $pbkdf2-sha512$v=1$i=<iterations>$<salt b64 no pad>$<hash b64 no pad>. Derivation: pre = HMAC-SHA256(pepper, UTF-8(NFKC(password))); key = PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA512(password = ASCII(base64url(pre) without padding), salt, iterations, 64 bytes). Cases marked testOnly use low iteration counts and a public pepper and must never be used outside tests.",
